Third-party material

The stimulus inputs reproduce third-party material for research (package
READMEs and distribution listings from installed packages, and public survey
and candidate tables). That material stays under its own terms and is not
covered by either license above. Model outputs recorded in the run files were
generated by the providers named in the run records.
